{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The chess roguelike. Play game-changing cards, bend the rules, save your Queen, and escape from the dungeon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First 3 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 10+ intermediate chess battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ magical cards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993260/extras/f43d1a5ba0b8252db4926c3ccc1aecf1.avif?t=1757850311\" width=1532 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat opponents of ever increasing difficulty to escape from the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build</strong> your chess army. Start with just a few figures and recruit more as you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect</strong>  cards to turn the tides of the battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat</strong> each enemy Queen on your way to freedom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993260/extras/4f4ac5167c7fd24217150adfcdf9e510.webp?t=1757850311\" width=800 height=20 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993260/extras/cfc213006da3bde5ab56b11020d1f608.avif?t=1757850311\" width=1532 height=466 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play cards to bend the rules of the game in your favour and win against unbeatable opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993260/extras/a6a3a9b460c1765697d24ca429f50149.poster.avif?t=1757850311\" width=616 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993260/extras/a6a3a9b460c1765697d24ca429f50149.webm?t=1757850311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend mana to play cards such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon a <strong>Shape Shifter</strong> that transforms into a random figure each turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start a <strong>zombie outbreak</strong> - zombie figures do not care for the colour and attack white or black equally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch an <strong>ICBM nuke</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build <strong>walls</strong> and <strong>traps</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch a <strong>propaganda campaign</strong> to turn enemy figures into your colour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many others!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993260/extras/4f4ac5167c7fd24217150adfcdf9e510.webp?t=1757850311\" width=800 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993260/extras/9b13bbd25a40b6c1d8613b456d372939.avif?t=1757850311\" width=1532 height=466 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win you either need to get smarter or to get stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every game you accumulate mana to buy new cards and chess pieces that stay with you in each new run.\u00a0<i>Maybe</i> you would even get a chance at escaping from the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993260/extras/a6eaf7d072786f06a939f72e02dab8ce.avif?t=1757850311\" width=1560 height=614 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of your upgrades will persist between runs, helping you to get closer and closer to the exit. Some will reset with each new run, making each new game unique.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3993260?t=1757850311","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993260/35d339d1ca2e40110f3181762526554e31a8e9e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757850311","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993260/f6a85bf3fcf9481d55a82669c550ca326321507a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757850311","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993260/f6a85bf3fcf9481d55a82669c550ca326321507a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757850311","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The chess roguelike. Play game-changing cards, bend the rules, save your Queen, and escape from the dungeon.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First 3 bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 10+ intermediate chess battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ magical cards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993260/extras/f43d1a5ba0b8252db4926c3cc